# Local dev artifacts must never enter the image build context.
# 2026-07-03 incident: an x86 dev .venv in code/ was COPY'd into the arm64
# image; `uv sync` died with "Exec format error" querying its python3, and
# (pre rc-isolation) the broken image still got pushed and deployed.
code/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
